DECISION: STOP -- do not force the alias edit.
================================================================================
The per-task instruction was explicit: "If they DON'T align, STOP and report -- do not
force." They do not align at the scoreboard's data layer (merged.json). Remapping 1907 to
production-1906-07 would score it against the 1906 extra session and report a false 476-chapter
residual. The blocker is upstream of the scoreboard: production-1906-07's
parsed_acts_merged.json was built from the 1906 extra-session pages, not the 1907 regular
session -- so the 1907 regular data is not present in any file the scoreboard reads. Fixing
this requires producing a merged.json for the 1907 regular session (a parse/merge artifact
change), which is OUT OF SCOPE for this measurement-only task and explicitly forbidden
(no parse/merged/certified/DB edits).

